          "end_s": 3.844954648526077,
          "text": "Elliot Ward with the five o'clock report."
        },
        {
          "start_s": 3.844954648526077,
          "end_s": 8.904954648526077,
          "text": "The grader will work the logging road tomorrow morning, so expect a short wait at the"
