          "text": "City rail is running on schedule."
        },
        {
          "start_s": 13.969954648526077,
          "end_s": 18.754954648526077,
          "text": "Fuel and grocery deliveries are due in town tomorrow afternoon."
        },
        {
          "start_s": 18.754954648526077,
          "end_s": 23.854954648526075,
          "text": "If you are working the late shift, keep warm and check in with someone."
        },
        {
          "start_s": 23.854954648526075,
