          "text": "Elliot Ward."
        },
        {
          "start_s": 3.9149546485260767,
          "end_s": 7.879954648526077,
          "text": "We lost contact with our city newsroom overnight."
        },
        {
          "start_s": 7.879954648526077,
          "end_s": 13.929954648526076,
          "text": "Cars have been arriving in North Ridge since three this morning, many with injured passengers, and"
        },
        {
          "start_s": 13.929954648526076,
          "end_s": 17.249954648526078,
          "text": "the clinic is treating them in its rear yard."
        },
        {
          "start_s": 17.249954648526078,
          "end_s": 19.804954648526078,
          "text": "The coast road is closed."
        },
        {
          "start_s": 19.804954648526078,
          "end_s": 25.564954648526076,
          "text": "Please stay home today unless you must travel, and keep the clinic road clear."
        },
        {
          "start_s": 25.564954648526076,
          "end_s": 27.469977324263038,
          "text": "Recap at noon."
